PERFORMANCE OPTIMIZATIONS
================================================================================

GPU Acceleration:
- All light layers use transform: translate(-50%, -50%)
- willChange: 'transform, opacity' on animated elements
- Fixed positioning prevents layout reflow
- Transitions use transform/opacity only (GPU properties)

Efficient Rendering:
- useMemo on expensive light interaction calculations
- Animation loop uses requestAnimationFrame (60fps locked)
- Prevents unnecessary re-renders via dependency arrays
- Touch events marked { passive: true } for scroll performance

React Optimization:
- Ref-based target position (no re-renders on every mousemove)
- State updates batched via RAF
- Conditional rendering of shadow (only when isBehindCard)
- Edge highlights conditionally rendered (only when scatterFactor > 0.2)

Reduced Calculations:
- Card bounds cached, only recalculated on resize
- Distance/angle calculations happen once per frame
- Normalized coordinates computed once and reused
- Shadow offset calculation inline, not separate effect

